        "faq_1": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How much does furniture pickup and delivery cost in Sydney?",
            "answer": "<p>It depends on the item, the distance between the two suburbs, stairs or lifts, and timing. We give you a fixed price before we start, so there is no hourly meter. Call 0469 717 535 or send your details for a quick price.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_2": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can you pick up and deliver furniture today?",
            "answer": "<p>Often, yes. We do same-day pickups across Sydney, 7 days a week. Call early in the day and we will confirm the earliest time we can get there.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_3": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you deliver just one item?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Single items are most of our work, such as one couch, one bed, one fridge or one table. There is no minimum job size.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_4": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can you collect my Facebook Marketplace or Gumtree purchase?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Send us the listing and the seller's suburb. We arrange a time with the seller, collect the item, and deliver it to your home.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_5": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you collect from stores like IKEA and Bunnings?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. We collect click and collect and in-store orders from IKEA, Bunnings, Harvey Norman, Amart, Fantastic Furniture, Freedom, JB Hi-Fi and other stores and warehouses across Sydney.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_6": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can you carry furniture up stairs or into an apartment?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Two movers carry items up stairs and into lifts. Tell us about stairs, lifts and parking at both ends so we bring the right gear.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_7": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is my furniture insured?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Items are covered while in our care, and everything is wrapped in blankets and strapped in the van.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_8": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Which areas of Sydney do you cover?",
            "answer": "<p>All of Greater Sydney, including Western Sydney, South West Sydney, the Inner West, the Eastern Suburbs, the North Shore, the Northern Beaches, the Hills District and the Sutherland Shire. We are based in Punchbowl.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_9": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I book?",
            "answer": "<p>Call 0469 717 535 or send your pickup and delivery suburbs, what you are moving and any stairs. We reply with a fixed price and the earliest time.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
